<title>USA: Sioux City feeder cattle steady-off $2 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City feeder cattle steady-off $2 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was moderate and compared to the previous week feeder steers and heifers sold steady to $2.00 per cwt lower on a thin test, USDA said. Large atttendance of local area buyers.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers: Medium and Large 1: 600-650 lbs 80.25; 650-700 lbs 73.50-75.25; 800-850 lbs 67.00-72.25; 870 lbs 70.25.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers: Medium and Large 1: 600-650 lbs 71.25-72.75; 650-700 lbs 68.75-73.00; 700-750 lbs 65.50-70.10;800-850 lbs 67.50-68.25; 909 lbs 65.75. Supply: 300</p>
